ew vertical, seasonal and naming conventions against physical observations.\",\n            \"Diagnose physical feeding and splitting before any junction coordinates or transport fractions.\",\n            \"Do not inherit lengths, widths, footprints or state relations across the link.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"connection:aleutian-to-alaska\",\n          \"subject_id\": \"current:aleutian\",\n          \"object_id\": \"current:alaska\",\n          \"predicate\": \"source_described_branching_relation\",\n          \"status\": \"local_research_candidate_not_canonical\",\n          \"source_url\": \"https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/aleutian-current/\",\n          \"source_locator\": \"Aleutian Current definition, second paragraph\",\n          \"source_access_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\n          \"source_read_status\": \"full_page_read\",\n          \"scope\": \"AMS describes the northward Alaska Current as an eastern branch of the Aleutian Current.\",\n          \"vertical_scope\": \"No fixed depth interval supplied; no quantified cross-layer transfer.\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"General glossary convention, not a dated or season-specific flow estimate.\",\n          \"junction_coordinate\": null,\n          \"transport_sv\": null,\n          \"canonical_admission\": false,\n          \"diagram_role\": \"schematic_identity_connection_not_measured_flow_path\",\n          \"remaining_gates\": [\n            \"Review vertical, seasonal and naming conventions against physical observations.\",\n            \"Diagnose physical feeding and splitting before any junction coordinates or transport fractions.\",\n            \"Do not inherit lengths, widths, footprints or state relations across the link.\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"connection:aleutian-to-california\",\n          \"subject_id\": \"current:aleutian\",\n          \"object_id\": \"current:california\",\n          \"predicate\": \"source_described_bran