\n          \"summary\": \"The 66 N to Cape Farewell editorial reach is separate from the source approximately 1000 km shelf survey. Weak northern identification and merging near 63 N limit continuity claims. The 30 km Cape Farewell width uses a 15% inner-jet velocity threshold and cannot buffer this whole route or supply annual margins.\",\n          \"source_url\": \"https://www.whoi.edu/cms/files/Sutherland_EGCC_revised_withfigs_33743.pdf\",\n          \"source_locator\": \"Sutherland and Pickart (2008), section 3: Cape Farewell and 66 N section geography; section 3.5: weak assumed northern jet near 68 N; sections 8-9: merging near 63 N and approximately 1000 km shelf survey description. Relevant text inspected, no current-axis figure digitized.\",\n          \"observed_period\": null\n        }\n      ],\n      \"evidence_links\": [],\n      \"object_url\": \"object.html?id=current%3Aeast-greenland-coastal\",\n      \"route_url\": \"reference-routes.html#east-greenland-coastal-reach-reference-path-candidate\",\n      \"season_url\": \"seasons.html?current=east-greenland-coastal\",\n      \"dashboard_search\": \"East Greenland Coastal Current Southeast Greenland shelf\",\n      \"width_ids\": [\n        \"east-greenland-coastal-2004-cape-farewell-threshold-section\"\n      ],\n      \"measurement_ids\": [\n        \"measurement:0017\"\n      ],\n      \"route_ids\": [\n        \"east-greenland-coastal-reach-reference-path-candidate\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"source:04dec95aff3639e3\",\n        \"source:4dc5fc618c26565f\",\n        \"source:4f7441b953be4651\",\n        \"source:803229fe82eb2360\",\n        \"source:a9cf41fd1887dc49\",\n        \"source:b038491b0e5a3967\"\n      ],\n      \"state_codes\": [],\n      \"published_length_km\": null,\n      \"width_sample_ids\": [],\n      \"route_decision_ids\": [\n        \"route-decision:east-greenland-coastal\"\n      ],\n      \"current_section_ids\": [],\n      \"velocity_sample_ids\": []\n  