             -40.002450164413915\n              ],\n              [\n                90.0,\n                -40.0\n              ]\n            ]\n          },\n          \"spatial_geometry_method\": \"WGS84 geodesic legs densified at <=10 km as in the existing reference-route state join; planar relation to coarse masked OSW display polygons.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"state_evidence\": [],\n      \"connections\": [],\n      \"scope_notes\": [\n        {\n          \"current_id\": \"south-indian\",\n          \"label\": \"Eastern naming convention and idealized transport reach\",\n          \"audit_file\": \"research/south-indian-eastern-reach-naming-layer-scope-audit.json\",\n          \"summary\": \"70–90 E is a declared regional reach under the eastern SIOC naming convention. Longitude gates are approximate context, and every latitude/connecting bend is editorial. Historical upper-1000 m transport is not a fixed-depth axis; western ARC, recirculation and northeastern continuation are not summed. Whole-current and annual dimensions remain unresolved.\",\n          \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1029/96JC03455\",\n          \"source_locator\": \"Stramma and Lutjeharms (1997) section 3.2; Grand et al. (2015) section 3.1.1; earlier/later naming conventions retained.\",\n          \"observed_period\": null,\n          \"related_current_ids\": [\n            \"agulhas-return\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"evidence_links\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Explore paired velocity, temperature and salinity profiles (2013)\",\n          \"url\": \"../figures/south-indian-hydrography-2013/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query all South Indian native hydrography cells\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?q=%7B%22collection%22%3A%22hydrography_samples%22%2C%22filters%22%3A%5B%7B%22field%22%3A%22investigation_current_id%22%2C%22op%22%3A%22eq%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22south-indian%22%7D%5D%2C%22limit%22%3A100%7D\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Inspect all 72 paired gradient and velocity candidate profiles\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Fsouth-indian-hycom-2013-paired-profile-candidates-v2.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fcases%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query unrounded paired monthly source fields\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Fsource-data%2Fhycom-south-indian-hydrography-2013%2Fmonthly-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonths%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Explore 100m/200m profiles and conditional potential temperature\",\n          \"url\": \"../figures/south-indian-front-levels-2013/\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query supplementary native cells and derived properties\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?q=%7B%22collection%22%3A%22hydrography_samples%22%2C%22filters%22%3A%5B%7B%22field%22%3A%22source_id%22%2C%22op%22%3A%22eq%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22source%3Ahycom-south-indian-front-levels-2013%22%7D%5D%2C%22limit%22%3A100%7D\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query complete supplementary raw monthly fields\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Fsource-data%2Fhycom-south-indian-front-levels-2013%2Fmonthly-fields.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonths%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Query conditional potential temperature and its support\",\n          \"url\": \"query.html?source-q=%7B%22document%22%3A%22research%2Fsouth-indian-2013-front-level-potential-temperature.json%22%2C%22pointer%22%3A%22%2Fmonths%22%2C%22limit%22%3A1%2C%22offset%22%3A0%7D#source-query-title\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Compare conditional property