n is not a whole-current length. Lomonosov is an established alternate name; Marine Regions spells it Lomonoscov.\",\r\n      \"name_source_url\": \"https://www.marineregions.org/gazetteer.php?p=details&id=30077\",\r\n      \"candidate_ids\": [\r\n        \"atlantic-euc-reach-reference-path-candidate\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"reference_path_decision\": \"editorial_candidate_present_scientific_review_pending\",\r\n      \"published_length_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"ledger_kind\": \"eastward subsurface jet\",\r\n      \"route_strategy_id\": \"layer_specific_route\",\r\n      \"route_strategy_label\": \"Construct layer-specific paths\",\r\n      \"planning_status\": \"editorial_planning_crosswalk_not_scientific_classification_approval\",\r\n      \"planning_basis\": \"A PIRATA ADCP observed the current at 0°N, 23°W in 2002; the station is not a whole-current length. Lomonosov is an established alternate name; Marine Regions spells it Lomonoscov.\",\r\n      \"next_action\": \"Review the existing editorial route against scientific gates; broader/system/family scope remains governed by the planning strategy.\",\r\n      \"strategy_next_action\": \"Specify source layer and time support, obtain intermediate pathway geometry, and separate branches or dilution thresholds before measuring.\",\r\n      \"known_component_currents\": [],\r\n      \"component_inventory_status\": \"not_assessed_by_this_planning_crosswalk\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"current_id\": \"atlantic-north-equatorial-countercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Atlantic North Equatorial Countercurrent\",\r\n      \"existing_length_evidence_status\": \"no_numeric_length\",\r\n      \"existing_scope\": \"Observed cores near 6.5°N and 8°N at 38°W in the 1998–2006 survey record, with marked seasonal variability. These cross-sections do not determine an along-current length.\",\r\n      \"name_source_url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1029/2007JC004215\",\r\n      \"candidate_ids\": [\r\n        \"atlantic-necc-western-summer-reference-path-candidate\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"reference_path_decision\": \"editorial_candidate_present_scientific_review_pending\",\r\n      \"published_length_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"ledger_kind\": \"eastward upper-ocean countercurrent\",\r\n      \"route_strategy_id\": \"expand_section_evidence\",\r\n      \"route_strategy_label\": \"Extend evidence beyond sections\",\r\n      \"planning_status\": \"editorial_planning_crosswalk_not_scientific_classification_approval\",\r\n      \"planning_basis\": \"Observed cores near 6.5°N and 8°N at 38°W in the 1998–2006 survey record, with marked seasonal variability. These cross-sections do not determine an along-current length.\",\r\n      \"next_action\": \"Review the existing editorial route against scientific gates; broader/system/family scope remains governed by the planning strategy.\",\r\n      \"strategy_next_action\": \"Find sourced upstream/downstream gates and continuity between sections; preserve widths and section transports as different measurements.\",\r\n      \"known_component_currents\": [],\r\n      \"component_inventory_status\": \"not_assessed_by_this_planning_crosswalk\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"current_id\": \"atlantic-north-equatorial-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Atlantic North Equatorial Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"existing_length_evidence_status\": \"no_numeric_length\",\r\n      \"existing_scope\": \"Direct observations near 5°N, 23°W cover a 65–270 m subsurface layer; variability is dominated by intraseasonal events, and the mooring does not determine basin-wide length.\",\r\n      \"name_source_url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1029/2020GL088350\",\r\n      \"candidate_ids\": [\r\n        \"atlantic-neuc-reach-reference-path-candidate\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"reference_path_decision\": \"editorial_candidate_present_scientific_review_pending\",\r\n      \"published_length_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"ledger_kind\": \"eastward subsurface jet\",\r\n      \"route