as abstract/data text specifies 2009 and detailed station occupation 26 Oct-1 Nov 2009. Follow explicit data text and retain discrepancy pending review.\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"dated_section\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": {\r\n        \"start\": \"2009-10-26\",\r\n        \"end\": \"2009-11-01\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"azores-countercurrent-2009-section-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"azores-countercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Azores Countercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_dated_section_span\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"meridional_section_span\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 110,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Source reports a rounded section span without a width uncertainty interval; not seasonal or annual variability.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"24.5 W meridional section, 35.25-36.25 N, ORCA stations 39-55 study. Not a uniform along-route width.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": {\r\n        \"type\": \"LineString\",\r\n        \"coordinates\": [\r\n          [\r\n            -24.5,\r\n            35.25\r\n          ],\r\n          [\r\n            -24.5,\r\n            36.25\r\n          ]\r\n        ],\r\n        \"crs\": \"OGC:CRS84\",\r\n        \"geometry_role\": \"source_reported_section_limits_not_current_footprint\"\r\n      },\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Meridional section; not reinterpreted as exact flow-normal span.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Westward counterflow with subsurface maximum and intermediate-water support; surface altimetry alone does not identify it. About 2000 m vertical extent in source; not uniform width at every depth.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"26 October-1 November 2009 station occupation within ORCA cruise 15 October-11 November 2009; single survey, not autumn climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Source-delimited current domain between 35.25 and 36.25 N based on hydrography and velocity/transport analysis. No universal velocity threshold assumed.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2011JC007129\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Comas-Rodriguez et al. (2011), The Azores Current System from a meridional section at 24.5 W, Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, doi:10.1029/2011JC007129.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Abstract [1], Data and Methods [6], current domains [12] and Discussion [15].\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_hydrographic_velocity_section\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Reported 110 km span transcribed; section limits recorded from prose. No source figure digitized or inferred axis width calculated.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review section boundary, vertical support and figure-caption date discrepancy.\",\r\n        \"Obtain repeated seasonal sections before annual variability or representative width.\",\r\n        \"Canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"26 Oct–1 Nov 2009 section\",\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Figure 1 caption says fall 2010, whereas abstract/data text specifies 2009 and detailed station occupation 26 Oct-1 Nov 2009. Follow explicit data text and retain discrepancy pending review.\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"dated_section\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": {\r\n        \"start\": \"2009-10-26\",\r\n        \"end\": \"2009-11-01\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent-mean-offshore-span\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"mediterranean-undercurrent\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Mediterranean Undercurrent\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_ensemble_one_sided_span\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"core_to_offshore_zero_crossing\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 30,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"No source-supplied width uncertainty. These different metrics and sampling supports do not establish a seasonal 10-30 km range.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Southern Portuguese slope, Region 1 of Figures 6-7; not the entire undercurrent.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Mean zonal velocity versus meridional distance from 36.8 N, binned at 10 km.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Nonmeddy lower-core RAFOS observations restricted to 950-1250 dbar.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"AMUSE ensemble; floats deployed May 1993-March 1994 and tracked up to 11 months. Launch dates are not observation end dates or an annual climatology.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Mean velocity maximum to offshore zero crossing only. Inshore fall to zero is not robust in the source; do not interpret as full paired-boundary width or double the value.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2001JC001007\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Bower, Serra and Ambar (2002), Structure of the Mediterranean Undercurrent and Mediterranean Water spreading around the southwestern Iberian Peninsula, doi:10.1029/2001JC001007.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 2 [7]; Section 3.2 [19]-[21] and Figure 7a.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_observational_analysis\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Approximate prose value transcribed with its detailed boundary definition; no figure digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Review boundary definition and regional/layer sampling.\",\r\n        \"Obtain comparable repeated observations before seasonal animation