rose width were not extracted.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/full/10.1029/2018JC014264\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Klenz, Dengler and Brandt (2018), Seasonal Variability of the Mauritania Current and Hydrography at 18 N, JGR: Oceans 123, 8122–8137, doi:10.1029/2018JC014264.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Section 5 width statement; section 2.1 and Table 2 sampling/remapping; section 3.1 and Figure 5 seasonal mean context.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-03\",\r\n      \"source_publication_year\": 2018,\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_observational_seasonal_mean_summary\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Width span transcribed from publisher conclusion; figures, edges and source arrays not digitized.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Recover paired boundaries and thresholds for the source seasonal mean.\",\r\n        \"Obtain compatible relaxation/other-season repeat widths; no annual extrema yet.\",\r\n        \"Independent canonical measurement admission and release review.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"December–April poleward undercurrent · seasonal mean\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"seasonal_mean_width_range\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": [\r\n        12,\r\n        1,\r\n        2,\r\n        3,\r\n        4\r\n      ],\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Five upwelling cruises support this mean. August 2016 was excluded from both seasonal means. The 60 km transport window and 200 km surface-flow context are not current widths.\",\r\n      \"calendar_source_locator\": \"Section 2.1 seasonal cruise assignment and Figure 5 caption.\",\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_mean_context\": {\r\n        \"reference_latitude_degrees\": 18,\r\n        \"pooled_latitude_bounds_degrees\": [\r\n          