ces do not establish a 10-40 km seasonal range; no mapped edges.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/jutland-nielsen-2000-cited-satellite-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"7e5b8d9899ca5eea3664c83ffc3f7f6457dc65934505285032ad04a64f9d7121\",\r\n        \"audit_pointer\": \"/measurements/1\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"jutland-nielsen-2000-hirtshals-cited-satellite-width\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"jutland\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Jutland Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_current_width\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": null,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": [\r\n        20,\r\n        25\r\n      ],\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"reported_typical_regional_width_span\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"One site-specific width description attributed to satellite imagery. Not a dated image diagnosis, paired velocity width, confidence interval, annual extrema or range across sites; no midpoint selected.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"Off Hirtshals, Jutland Coastal Current, eastern North Sea / Skagerrak; geographic section coordinates not extracted.\",\r\n      \"section_geometry\": null,\r\n      \"section_orientation\": \"Reported satellite-image current breadth at a named coastal site; no flow-normal transect orientation recovered.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Satellite-image description; measurement depth not recovered. Mixed-water and local bathymetry context do not fix a width layer.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"Undated image-derived estimate summarized in the April 1999 thesis reprinted October 2000, citing Aarup 1994a. Publication and hydrographic-study years are not width occupation dates.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author-reported width attributed to satellite imagery; image classification threshold, sensor and exact edge rule not recovered.\",\r\n    