 error.\",\r\n      \"source_url\": \"https://doi.org/10.1029/93JC00051\",\r\n      \"source_citation\": \"Richardson, P. L. and Schmitz, W. J., Jr. (1993), Deep Cross-Equatorial Flow in the Atlantic Measured With SOFAR Floats, Journal of Geophysical Research 98(C5), 8371-8387, doi:10.1029/93JC00051.\",\r\n      \"source_locator\": \"Final original PDF p5 / printed p8375, section 3.2 continuation; Table 2 PDF p8 / p8378; nominal depth and processing p2; subset sampling p6 and Figure 6 p7.\",\r\n      \"source_retrieved_date\": \"2026-10-09\",\r\n      \"source_evidence_kind\": \"published_original_lagrangian_velocity_composite\",\r\n      \"extraction_method\": \"Visually reviewed numerical passage, Table 2 and methods transcribed; no plot-edge digitization or raw velocity recalculation.\",\r\n      \"whole_current_representative\": false,\r\n      \"width_rank_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"full_width_inference_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"annual_extrema_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"seasonal_playback_eligible\": false,\r\n      \"is_confidence_interval\": false,\r\n      \"phase_label\": \"Historical upper-core float composite\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"lagrangian_composite_zero_velocity_width\",\r\n      \"observed_period\": null,\r\n      \"calendar_months\": null,\r\n      \"fixed_layer_bounds_m\": null,\r\n      \"uncertainty_km\": null,\r\n      \"source_quality_note\": \"Composite and subset sampling are sparse and nonuniform. Nominal float depths drifted. Source-label and count inconsistencies are preserved; velocity/transport standard errors are not width errors.\",\r\n      \"remaining_gates\": [\r\n        \"Acquire and reprocess raw calibrated float records with their changing depths.\",\r\n        \"Recover geographically supported zero-velocity edges before footprints or physical state intersections.\",\r\n        \"Repeated compatible sections and width errors before annual margins or seasonal playback.\",\r\n        \"Independent scientific admission.\"\r\n      ],\r\n      \"width_metric_label\": \"Zero-velocity width of along-isobath float composite\",\r\n      \"original_regional_context\": {\r\n        \"description_kind\": \"dwbc_upper_core_float_composite\",\r\n        \"width_passage_visually_inspected\": true,\r\n        \"underlying_width_methods_reviewed\": true,\r\n        \"full_study_reproduced\": false,\r\n        \"temporal_operator\": \"nonuniform_historical_lagrangian_composite\",\r\n        \"nominal_float_depth_m\": 1800,\r\n        \"nominal_depth_is_fixed_layer\": false,\r\n        \"source_estimated_float_sinking_m\": 230,\r\n        \"averaging_bin_km\": 10,\r\n        \"bin_size_is_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"velocity_errors_are_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"transport_errors_are_width_uncertainty\": false,\r\n        \"geographic_edges_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"map_buffer_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"cross_current_width_inheritance_eligible\": false,\r\n        \"seasonal_calendar_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"source_table_rows\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"period_label\": \"Composite: Jan 1989-Oct 1990\",\r\n            \"current_width_km\": 100,\r\n            \"floats_in_current\": 8,\r\n            \"observations_in_current\": 500,\r\n            \"peak_individual_velocity_range_cm_s\": [\r\n              50,\r\n              60\r\n            ],\r\n            \"maximum_bin_average_velocity_cm_s\": 26,\r\n            \"maximum_bin_average_standard_error_cm_s\": 5,\r\n            \"transport_per_unit_depth_10_3_m2_s\": 14,\r\n            \"transport_per_unit_depth_standard_error_10_3_m2_s\": 3,\r\n            \"total_volume_transport_sv\": 15\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"period_label\": \"Jan 1989-Oct 1989\",\r\n            \"current_width_km\": 100,\r\n            \"floats_in_current\": 4,\r\n            \"observations_in_current\": 124,\r\n            \"peak_individual_velocity_range_cm_s\": [\r\n              50,\r