rinted p8378\",\r\n        \"source_scope_discrepancy_note\": \"Table 2 labels 2 S-12 N west of 43 W; section 3.2 describes 0-7 N and 12 months. Historical composite period labels remain source-specific.\",\r\n        \"subset_observation_count_sum\": 489,\r\n        \"composite_observation_count\": 500,\r\n        \"subset_counts_additive\": false,\r\n        \"subset_count_discrepancy_note\": \"Published subset observation counts 124+188+177 total 489, not composite 500. No adjustment or missing-record explanation inferred.\",\r\n        \"source_sampling_gap_label\": \"No floats drifted in the boundary current April-December 1989 (Figure 4 caption).\",\r\n        \"gap_means_current_absent\": false,\r\n        \"independent_subset_width_edges_extracted\": false,\r\n        \"source_prose_transport_per_unit_depth_10_3_m2_s\": 13.8,\r\n        \"alternative_subset_based_transport_standard_error_10_3_m2_s\": 4,\r\n        \"source_total_volume_transport_unrounded_sv\": 14.7,\r\n        \"volume_transport_support_note\": \"Total transport couples float horizontal profile with an independent current-meter profile, assumes elliptical shape and integrates 900-2800 m. These are transport construction bounds, not the width layer.\",\r\n        \"display_title\": \"Upper-core float-composite width\",\r\n        \"display_aria_label\": \"Deep Western Boundary Current upper-core float composite: approximately 100 kilometres between zero-velocity points. Nominal drifting 1800 m floats, nonuniform historical samples; width uncertainty unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_caption\": \"Approximately 100 km source composite width. All four Table 2 rows repeat 100 km; no independent temporal edge series, annual margins or width error supplied.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Along-isobath velocity averaging in 10 km bins. Nominal float depth is not a fixed layer. Historical subset speeds and transport have their own standard errors; those do not measure width uncertainty.\",\