ic speed 0.66 m/s. Reference pressure 1600 dbar is not a depth slab. Numerical uncertainty and annual range unknown.\",\r\n        \"display_method_note\": \"Southern limit fixed at Los Roques, 12 N; typical stations 60 nautical miles apart. The separate historical 108 nautical miles to 225 miles range retains an unresolved upper unit. No mapped edges or seasonal animation inferred.\",\r\n        \"audit_file\": \"research/caribbean-duncan-1982-dated-width-scope-audit.json\",\r\n        \"audit_sha256\": \"e9abd7a125b736381a2e29313fc30c2feac6711943ec5f35780d287f51fc9d2c\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"id\": \"hiri-hughes-1993-1987-07-local-decay-scale\",\r\n      \"current_id\": \"hiri-current\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Hiri Current\",\r\n      \"status\": \"editorial_source_extraction_not_canonical\",\r\n      \"measurement_type\": \"published_regional_summary\",\r\n      \"phase_kind\": \"regional_summary\",\r\n      \"width_metric\": \"author_reported_e_folding_scale\",\r\n      \"width_metric_label\": \"local e-folding scale\",\r\n      \"approximate_width_km\": 50,\r\n      \"width_range_km\": null,\r\n      \"range_kind\": \"dated_local_point_descriptor_not_temporal_range\",\r\n      \"range_interpretation\": \"Author-reported local descriptor. No statistical error, full-current inference or annual range supplied.\",\r\n      \"geographic_scope\": \"A87 northern transect near Rossel Island, southern Papua coast, looking from the east.\",\r\n      \"layer\": \"Thermal-wind cross-section context; no numerical fixed-depth width layer. Transport integration to 1500 dbar does not define the width support.\",\r\n      \"time_convention\": \"July 1987 cruise occupation; exact day unresolved. Different reaches and years are not a recurring seasonal series.\",\r\n      \"boundary_rule\": \"Author e-folding scaling width; lateral fit, reference velocity and paired velocity edges not independently reconstructed. No theoretical full-width multiplier.\",\r\n      \